# Sethos Nahida Fischl Mavuika. ~16 Rot. Sethos looses a Shadowpeircing shot at the start of the chamber and 2 after a second skill at the end of his burst. Mavuika bursts every other rotation. Nahida fills time for Sethos skill CD on subsequent rotations.

# Team- Options listed by DPS
sethos char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
